WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.780
Now let's look at how to register for the first time.

2
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.780
That is, when we've come to this portal, done nothing yet, registered nowhere,

3
00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:17.290
haven't been on GitHub – what do we do?

4
00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:24.460
We can simply click "needs review" on any video. We

5
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:29.800
will land on the GitHub site; this is simply to get to GitHub.

6
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:34.880
And we click Sign up – to register, to sign up.

7
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:42.160
Here we choose... If you have a Google account, that's the easiest.

8
00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:49.010
Or Apple. We click Google and choose the right account – your personal one.

9
00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.590
Here we enter the name we want; it's just a nickname.

10
00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.400
We choose the country,

11
00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:03.760
leave the checkbox unticked and click "Create account".

12
00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:10.160
Once the account has been created, we pass on either our e-mail, this one,

13
00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:14.380
the one you chose, or this name here, to me.

14
00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:21.160
This is a one-time step to add your account to the list of those who can

15
00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:24.860
work with the project and make changes to it.
